  /Subject (La V\351lodyss\351e \(EuroVelo 1\) runs from Roscoff to Hendaye. From Nantes, it reaches the ocean along the Loire estuary, then heads down the C\364te de Jade and the Vend\351e coast: marshes, beaches, pine forests and fishing ports.) /Title (La V\351lodyss\351e \205 Route sheet | Bike'N Tour) /Trapped /False
